WEBVTT

00:13:57.454 --> 00:14:00.912
And I think we spend way too much
time thinking in these modes.

00:14:00.912 --> 00:14:05.412
I know, you know, as somebody who's been
called a logic bully once or twice,

00:14:05.412 --> 00:14:07.954
maybe seven times at this point,
by my count,

00:14:08.829 --> 00:14:11.121
I spend too much time in prosecutor mode.

00:14:11.121 --> 00:14:15.329
And when I think that somebody is selling
snake oil or trying to, you know,

00:14:15.371 --> 00:14:18.371
indoctrinate their followers into
some kind of idea cult,

00:14:19.037 --> 00:14:22.621
I feel like it's my job to debunk those
myths and bring the better evidence to

00:14:22.621 --> 00:14:25.704
the table. And the problem is then
that I get too close minded.

00:14:25.829 --> 00:14:28.537
And so I'm trying to get
out of prosecutor mode

00:14:28.871 --> 00:14:31.662
and spend more time thinking
like a scientist,